"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_named_legendary_entity_with_commentary","target_mention_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru:m016-0103","c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0036","c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0362"],"historical_event_attendance_not_inferred":true},"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p016","quote":"「於是乎離宮別館，彌山跨谷，高廊四注，重坐曲閣，華榱璧璫，輦道纚屬，步朓周流，長途中宿。夷顒築堂，累台增成，岩穾洞房，俯杳眇而無見，仰攀橑而捫天，奔星更於閨闥，宛虹拖於楯軒。青虯蚴蟉於東箱，象輿婉蟬於西清，靈圉燕於間觀，偓佺之倫暴於南榮，醴泉湧於清室，通川過乎中庭。槃石裖崖，嶔岩倚傾，嵯峨磼酺，刻削崢嶸，玫瑰碧琳，珊瑚叢生，渼玉旁唐，瑸斒文鱗，赤瑕駁犖，雜臿其間，垂綏琬琰，和氏出焉。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru:m016-0103"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p052","quote":"邪絕少陽而登太陰兮，與真人乎相求。互折窈窕以右轉兮，橫厲飛泉以正東。悉徵靈圉而選之兮，部乘眾神於瑤光。使五帝先導兮，反太一而從陵陽。左玄冥而右含靁兮，前陸離而後潏湟。厮征北僑而役羡門兮，屬岐伯使尚方。祝融驚而蹕御兮，清氛氣而後行。屯余車其萬乘兮，綷雲蓋而樹華旗。使勾芒其將行兮，吾欲往乎南嬉。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0036"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p058","quote":"軒轅之前，遐哉邈乎，其詳不可得聞也。五三六經載籍之傳，維見可觀也。書曰「元首明哉，股肱良哉」。因斯以談，君莫盛於唐堯，臣莫賢於后稷。后稷創業於唐，公劉發跡於西戎，文王改制，爰周郅隆，大行越成，而後陵夷衰微，千載無聲，豈不善始善終哉。然無異端，慎所由於前，謹遺教於後耳。故軌跡夷易，易遵也；湛恩濛湧，易豐也；憲度著明，易則也；垂統理順，易繼也。是以業隆於繦褓而崇冠於二后。揆厥所元，終都攸卒，未有殊尤絕跡可考於今者也。然猶躡梁父，登泰山，建顯號，施尊名。大漢之德，逢湧原泉，沕潏漫衍，旁魄四塞，雲尃霧散，上暢九垓，下溯八埏。懷生之類霑濡浸潤，協氣橫流，武節飄逝，邇陝游原，迥闊泳沫，首惡湮沒，闇昧昭晢，昆蟲凱澤，回首面內。然後囿騶虞之珍群，徼麋鹿之怪獸，鰜一莖六穗於庖，犧雙共抵之獸，獲周餘珍收龜於岐，招翠黃乘龍於沼。鬼神接靈圉，賓於間館。奇物譎詭，俶儻窮變。欽哉，符瑞臻茲，猶以為薄，不敢道封禪。蓋周躍魚隕杭，休之以燎，微夫斯之為符也，以登介丘，不亦恧乎！進讓之道，其何爽與？","mention_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0362"]}],"references":[{"title":"《史記集解》卷117·郭璞注靈圉","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0002/blob/73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7/KR2a0002_117.txt#L236-L237","quote":"靈圉燕於間觀（郭璞曰：靈圉、淳圉，仙人名也）","source_commit":"73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7","source_blob":"ccded97eee2542083010172d857d6251a09a126c","verified_extent":{"start_line":234,"end_line":238},"cached_response_sha256":"5670a732029106c195457e0060b75ead60be5cadd956b7ab06985bc21be94c09","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記集解》卷117·郭璞注靈圉為仙人名","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0002/blob/73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7/KR2a0002_117.txt#L596-L597","quote":"鬼神接靈圉，賓於閒館。郭璞曰：「靈圉，仙人名也。」","source_commit":"73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7","source_blob":"ccded97eee2542083010172d857d6251a09a126c","verified_extent":{"start_line":594,"end_line":598},"cached_response_sha256":"5670a732029106c195457e0060b75ead60be5cadd956b7ab06985bc21be94c09","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"《大人賦》p016、p052三見同一詞形「靈圉」；p058《封禪文》又在「鬼神接靈圉」語境重見。裴駰《集解》引郭璞明釋靈圉為仙人名，足以將三處來源所指立為同一傳說人物；郭注所見「淳圉」作注文異寫保留，不改正文或收入異名。此判斷不證成仙人實有、賦中神話事件為史實，亦不推生卒、親屬或官職。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p016","text":"「於是乎離宮別館，彌山跨谷，高廊四注，重坐曲閣，華榱璧璫，輦道纚屬，步朓周流，長途中宿。夷顒築堂，累台增成，岩穾洞房，俯杳眇而無見，仰攀橑而捫天，奔星更於閨闥，宛虹拖於楯軒。青虯蚴蟉於東箱，象輿婉蟬於西清，靈圉燕於間觀，偓佺之倫暴於南榮，醴泉湧於清室，通川過乎中庭。槃石裖崖，嶔岩倚傾，嵯峨磼酺，刻削崢嶸，玫瑰碧琳，珊瑚叢生，渼玉旁唐，瑸斒文鱗，赤瑕駁犖，雜臿其間，垂綏琬琰，和氏出焉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m016-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"靈圉","kind":"person","person_id":"93v_7o4_i4q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《集解》郭璞注「靈圉，淳圉，仙人名也」；與本篇另兩見「靈圉」按同一篇賦的連續神仙敘事暫同指。保留正文用字，不把注文「淳圉」改作正文別名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m016-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"偓佺","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","book_id":"b-shiji-117","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p052","text":"邪絕少陽而登太陰兮，與真人乎相求。互折窈窕以右轉兮，橫厲飛泉以正東。悉徵靈圉而選之兮，部乘眾神於瑤光。使五帝先導兮，反太一而從陵陽。左玄冥而右含靁兮，前陸離而後潏湟。厮征北僑而役羡門兮，屬岐伯使尚方。祝融驚而蹕御兮，清氛氣而後行。屯余車其萬乘兮，綷雲蓋而樹華旗。使勾芒其將行兮，吾欲往乎南嬉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"真人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"靈圉","kind":"person","person_id":"93v_7o4_i4q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《集解》郭璞注「靈圉，淳圉，仙人名也」；與本篇另兩見「靈圉」按同一篇賦的連續神仙敘事暫同指。保留正文用字，不把注文「淳圉」改作正文別名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"眾神","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"本句神帝群稱，不指定五個世系人物；五畤與古注轉報五時分存。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"太一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"本處太一為祠祀神祇稱號，非本資料庫所建歷史人物；指稱性質與異文另見 referent_interpretations。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"陵陽","kind":"person","person_id":"i4v_y28_wx0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"古注明稱仙人陵陽子明，與陽子古注所述陽陵子不能倒字合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"玄冥","kind":"person","person_id":"dal_xne_xt3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"古注稱北方黑帝之佐，只記神話身份，不補官爵任期或與其他祖系相接。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"含靁","kind":"person","person_id":"21k_m7f_sxc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本篇含靁依所引注為黔嬴，造化神與水神兩說分存；不改原字，不將外部用字冒作本文別名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"陸離","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"本篇陸離與漢書長離的神名／靈鳥解釋分存，未改字或強接個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"潏湟","kind":"person","person_id":"oj8_zfy_dkl","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本篇潏湟依注為神名；漢書矞皇用字另存，不先作跨見證別名定論。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"北僑","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"本篇北僑與《漢書》伯僑用字不同；各注解釋與分詞並存，未把北、伯或征字自動改寫，也未接成已定人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"羡門","kind":"person","person_id":"44s_fyq_t0d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"張揖釋碣石仙人羡門高，與始皇本紀碣石求羨門的名號及地域互證；保留羡／羨原字，不把高誓併成同名，也不補仙人生卒或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"岐伯","kind":"person","person_id":"l4l_iz8_ao0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本篇岐伯主方藥，張揖明釋黃帝太醫；孝武本紀公玉帶亦引黃帝時岐伯，暫接同一傳說人物，不據賦辭增造官職或出行事件。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"祝融","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"勾芒","kind":"person","person_id":"hd8_aho_qei","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本篇勾芒與漢書句芒各存，古注稱東方青帝之佐；不按造形補生平或親屬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","book_id":"b-shiji-117","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p058","text":"軒轅之前，遐哉邈乎，其詳不可得聞也。五三六經載籍之傳，維見可觀也。書曰「元首明哉，股肱良哉」。因斯以談，君莫盛於唐堯，臣莫賢於后稷。后稷創業於唐，公劉發跡於西戎，文王改制，爰周郅隆，大行越成，而後陵夷衰微，千載無聲，豈不善始善終哉。然無異端，慎所由於前，謹遺教於後耳。故軌跡夷易，易遵也；湛恩濛湧，易豐也；憲度著明，易則也；垂統理順，易繼也。是以業隆於繦褓而崇冠於二后。揆厥所元，終都攸卒，未有殊尤絕跡可考於今者也。然猶躡梁父，登泰山，建顯號，施尊名。大漢之德，逢湧原泉，沕潏漫衍，旁魄四塞，雲尃霧散，上暢九垓，下溯八埏。懷生之類霑濡浸潤，協氣橫流，武節飄逝，邇陝游原，迥闊泳沫，首惡湮沒，闇昧昭晢，昆蟲凱澤，回首面內。然後囿騶虞之珍群，徼麋鹿之怪獸，鰜一莖六穗於庖，犧雙共抵之獸，獲周餘珍收龜於岐，招翠黃乘龍於沼。鬼神接靈圉，賓於間館。奇物譎詭，俶儻窮變。欽哉，符瑞臻茲，猶以為薄，不敢道封禪。蓋周躍魚隕杭，休之以燎，微夫斯之為符也，以登介丘，不亦恧乎！進讓之道，其何爽與？","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"軒轅","kind":"person","person_id":"8jz_o3s_obt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"唐堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"jqy_1fv_u7v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"jqy_1fv_u7v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"二后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0362","start":362,"end":364,"surface":"靈圉","kind":"person","person_id":"93v_7o4_i4q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《集解》郭璞注「靈圉，淳圉，仙人名也」；與本篇另兩見「靈圉」按同一篇賦的連續神仙敘事暫同指。保留正文用字，不把注文「淳圉」改作正文別名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","book_id":"b-shiji-117","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-117","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru","source":{"title":"史記／卷117","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷117","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷117&oldid=10371549","revision_id":10371549,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定修訂全文71段，包括賦、書與末段索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2、目錄標記及現代節標；quote模板保留全文，br轉段落；罕字模板保留第一參數字形，描述未作正文；連結保留顯示字。未核影像。 移除防轉換控制外殼，保留內字云。","note":"第58段U+E0FA私用字缺字與頌中重句原樣保存，不猜補；末段索隱述贊分層。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true}}
